Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|portlet.plugins.includes|akismet-portlet|
		|testray.main.component.name|Akismet|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	Then WikiNode add Main CP

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Mark As Not Spam Wiki Page
Priority: 4
	Given TestCase get Site Name
##########################################################
The Poshi return element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Apps
		|portlet|Akismet|
	And AkismetPortlet configure
		|enableSpamModerationFor|Wiki|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit User Site CP
		|siteName|${siteName}|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Roles|
	And Role define Permission Cmd CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_WIKI_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ACCESS_IN_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Access in Site Administration|
		|roleTitle|Authenticated|
		|roleUser|User|
	And User first Login PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiNavigator goto Node
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And WikiNavigator goto All Pages CP
	And WikiPage add CP
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki Page Content|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
	And User logout PG
	And User login PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiNavigator goto Node
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And WikiNavigator goto CP
		|wikiPageRevision|1.0|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
		|wikiPageUsername|userfn userln|
	And WikiPage mark As Spam CP
		|wikiPageRevision|1.0|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Spam Moderation|
	And SpamModerationPortlet navigate To Wikis
	And SpamModerationPortlet Mark As Not Spam
		|assetType|wikiPage|
		|wikiPageRevision|1.0|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
		|wikiPageUsername|userfn userln|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Spam Moderation|
	And SpamModerationPortlet view Default
		|assetType|wikiPage|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiNavigator goto Node
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And WikiNavigator goto CP
		|wikiPageRevision|1.0|
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page Title|
		|wikiPageUsername|userfn userln|
	Then WikiPage view CP
		|akismetEnabled|true|
		|wikiPageRevision|1.0|
